        <activityName xml:lang="en">Network equipment, at data center</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Network equipment, at data center
The data center contains a share of power supply unit and network switch; UUID: 2a8c200e-7391-36d9-ab9e-d063e23f3df1
The dataset assumes that 2 power supply units are needed per switch (source: UBA 2021, Table 75). Number of switches per data centre are an average of 9 data centres in Germany and Switzerland.
Location: Global average data centers.
Technology: Power supply units and network switches are considered.
Time period: Unspecified
Production volume: unknown
Sampling: Literature &amp; own estimations
Extrapolations: 
Uncertainty adjustments: 
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_2a8c200e-7391-36d9-ab9e-d063e23f3df1.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
